egin="00:36.886" end="00:37.182">You're </span><span begin="00:37.182" end="00:37.606">kinda </span><span begin="00:37.606" end="00:38.150">cute </span><span begin="00:38.150" end="00:38.560">but </span><span begin="00:38.560" end="00:40.545">it's </span><span begin="00:40.545" end="00:42.955">raining </span><span begin="00:42.955" end="00:44.883">harder</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.355" end="00:49.089"><span begin="00:45.355" end="00:45.635">My </span><span begin="00:45.635" end="00:46.161">shoes </span><span begin="00:46.161" end="00:46.384">are </span><span begin="00:46.384" end="00:46.769">now </span><span begin="00:46.769" end="00:47.121">full </span><span begin="00:47.121" end="00:47.537">of </span><span begin="00:47.537" end="00:49.089">water</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.283" end="00:56.282"><span begin="00:50.283" end="00:51.922">Lovely </span><span begin="00:51.922" end="00:52.153">to </span><span begin="00:52.153" end="00:52.433">be </span><span begin="00:52.433" end="00:52.793">rained </span><span begin="00:52.793" end="00:53.609">on </span><span begin="00:53.609" end="00:53.873">with </span><span begin="00:53.873" end="00:56.282">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.282" end="01:01.975"><span begin="00:56.282" end="00:56.585">It's </span><span begin="00:56.585" end="00:57.003">kinda </span><span begin="00:57.003" end="00:57.849">cute </span><span begin="00:57.849" end="00:58.105">but </span><span begin="00:58.105" end="00:59.887">it's </span><span begin="00:59.887" end="01:00.191">so </span><span begin="01:00.191" end="01:01.975">short</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.975" end="01:04.261"><span begin="01:01.975" end="01:02.021">Then </span><span begin="01:02.021" end="01:02.252">you're </span><span begin="01:02.252" end="01:02.965">driving </span><span begin="01:02.965" end="01:03.189">me </span><span begin="01:03.189" end="01:04.261">home</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.261" end="01:06.653"><span begin="0